            "figure_ids": []
          },
          {
            "id": "F",
            "text": "$x_n=3n-2$ 对应 $1$，$4$，$9$，$16$，$25$。",
            "figure_ids": []
          },
          {
            "id": "G",
            "text": "$x_n=\\frac{n}{n+1}$ 对应 $\\frac{1}{2}$，$\\frac{2}{3}$，$\\frac{3}{4}$，$\\frac{4}{5}$，$\\frac{5}{6}$。",
            "figure_ids": []
          },
          {
            "id": "H",
            "text": "$x_n=\\frac{n+1}{n}$ 对应 $\\frac{1}{2}$，$\\frac{2}{3}$，$\\frac{3}{4}$，$\\frac{4}{5}$，$\\frac{5}{6}$。",
